⟦BEGIN TOOL MANIFEST⟧
  ⟦BEGIN NAME⟧GoParser⟦END NAME⟧
  ⟦BEGIN VERSION⟧1.0⟦END VERSION⟧
  ⟦BEGIN DESCRIPTION⟧Parses Go source code into an abstract representation⟦END DESCRIPTION⟧
  ⟦BEGIN CAPABILITIES⟧
    ⟦BEGIN CAPABILITY⟧parse⟦END CAPABILITY⟧
  ⟦END CAPABILITIES⟧
  ⟦BEGIN ACTIONS⟧
    ⟦BEGIN ACTION⟧
      ⟦BEGIN ACTION NAME⟧parse⟦END ACTION NAME⟧
      ⟦BEGIN ARGUMENTS⟧
        ⟦BEGIN ARGUMENT⟧
          ⟦BEGIN NAME⟧source_code⟦END NAME⟧
          ⟦BEGIN TYPE⟧string⟦END TYPE⟧
          ⟦BEGIN REQUIRED⟧true⟦END REQUIRED⟧
        ⟦END ARGUMENT⟧
      ⟦END ARGUMENTS⟧
      ⟦BEGIN RETURNS⟧
        ⟦BEGIN TYPE⟧string⟦END TYPE⟧
      ⟦END RETURNS⟧
      ⟦BEGIN SIDE EFFECTS⟧
        ⟦BEGIN EFFECT⟧none⟦END EFFECT⟧
      ⟦END SIDE EFFECTS⟧
      ⟦BEGIN IDEMPOTENT⟧true⟦END IDEMPOTENT⟧
      ⟦BEGIN COST EXPRESSION⟧50 + (source_len / 1000)⟦END COST EXPRESSION⟧
      ⟦BEGIN TIMEOUT MS⟧30000⟦END TIMEOUT MS⟧
      ⟦BEGIN RETRY POLICY⟧
        ⟦BEGIN MAX ATTEMPTS⟧1⟦END MAX ATTEMPTS⟧
        ⟦BEGIN DELAY MS⟧0⟦END DELAY MS⟧
      ⟦END RETRY POLICY⟧
      ⟦BEGIN PERMISSIONS⟧
        ⟦BEGIN PERMISSION⟧read_source⟦END PERMISSION⟧
      ⟦END PERMISSIONS⟧
      ⟦BEGIN PRECONDITIONS⟧
        ⟦BEGIN PRECONDITION⟧source_code != empty⟦END PRECONDITION⟧
      ⟦END PRECONDITIONS⟧
      ⟦BEGIN POSTCONDITIONS⟧
        ⟦BEGIN POSTCONDITION⟧result != empty⟦END POSTCONDITION⟧
      ⟦END POSTCONDITIONS⟧
      ⟦BEGIN BUNDLE STRATEGY⟧never⟦END BUNDLE STRATEGY⟧
    ⟦END ACTION⟧
  ⟦END ACTIONS⟧
⟦END TOOL MANIFEST⟧